#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/gui-domain.rst:52
#: 04f01a6da52443d4ae052ab1c80020da
msgid ""
"To use sys-gui, shutdown all your running qubes , and log out. Before you "
"log back in change the session type to **GUI domain (sys-gui)** in the top "
"right corner of the login screen. Once logged in, you are running ``sys-"
"gui`` as a fullscreen window and you can work as if you were in the ``dom0`` "
"desktop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/gui-domain.rst:54
#: 4cbf7e86c8c64f48a8fdd3122f2272cb
msgid ""
"**Note:** In order to go back to ``dom0`` desktop, you need to logout and "
"then change the  ``lightdm`` session to **Session Xfce**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/gui-domain.rst:57
#: b6a0c4e2b06b49ccb1894478d23ec573
msgid "GPU GUI domain (``sys-gui-gpu``)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/gui-domain.rst:60
#: 33aa3b36a0e6425ba14831452246ae21
msgid ""
"Here, we describe how to setup ``sys-gui-gpu`` which is a GUI domain with "
"*GPU passthrough* in `GUI domain <https://www.qubes-os.org/news/2020/03/18/"
"gui-domain/>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/gui-domain.rst:62
#: ead93fc2cd874c4e9d4398bcf52f680b
msgid ""
"**Note:** the purpose of ``sys-gui-gpu`` is to improve Qubes OS security by "
"detaching the GPU from dom0, this is not intended to improve GPU related "
"performance within qubes, and this will not improve performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/gui-domain.rst:64
